From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/rockchip: tve: report an unsensed connector as unknown

The TV encoder cannot sense a load, yet reported its connector connected
with nothing plugged. The fbdev console then sized itself to 720x576 on
every screen, HDMI's too. Unknown is the status for a connector that cannot
tell: clients use it when nothing else is connected.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_tve.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_tve.c
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_tve.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/rockchip/rockchip_drm_tve.c
@@ -177,7 +177,7 @@ static void rockchip_encoder_destroy(str
 static enum drm_connector_status
 rockchip_tve_connector_detect(struct drm_connector *connector, bool force)
 {
-	return connector_status_connected;
+	return connector_status_unknown;
 }
 
 static void rockchip_tve_connector_destroy(struct drm_connector *connector)
